# HOHO Tour cache policy (Cloudflare Pages, 2026-11-19 hero revamp).
# Fingerprinted CSS/JS carry a content hash in the URL, so they can be cached
# immutably. HTML must always revalidate: the old unversioned /css/style.css
# stayed cached for hours after the 16:20 deploy and the new hero markup
# rendered with old styles ("banner looks like broken plain text"). With HTML
# no-cache + fingerprinted CSS, a deploy can never show a stale hero again.
# Rules are first-match-wins: specific asset rules come before the catch-all.
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
